Package: tcrpheno
Title: Assigns T cell Phenotype Propensity Scores to TCR sequences 
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: 
    person(given = "Kaitlyn",
           family = "Lagattuta",
           role = c("aut", "cre"),
           email = "kalaga12@gmail.com",
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0002-2950-6238"))
Description: This R package is built around one central function, score_tcrs(), which receives T cell receptor data as input and returns a set of numeric scores for each input T cell receptor. Each score indicates a propensity for a particular T cell phenotype, such as innate-like MAIT or NKT cells. See PMID: 39731734 for development and interpretation of TCR scores.
